# HW: 2x NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090, 32607 MiB | Config MAX: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B Q8 + Qwen3-Embedding-8B Q8
# Build: lilbee 0.6.90b420.dev721 cu124 | Recorded: 2026-07-17
# Measured (probe this pod): boot window 75s, gen window 107s -- see timings.json
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono ExtraBold, Symbols Nerd Font Mono, Noto Color Emoji"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "rose-pine-moon"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 30
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 25
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Env COLORTERM "truecolor"
Env TERM "xterm-256color"
Output tui-tow-limits.gif
Output tui-tow-limits.mp4
Hide
Type "source /root/kit/env.sh && lilbee"
Enter
Sleep 75s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+g
Sleep 12s
Show
Sleep 2s
Type "i"
Sleep 400ms
Type@15ms "A customer wants to tow a 3,500 lb boat trailer with this car. Can it handle that load? What are its actual towing and payload limits in pounds, and what does the manual say to check before towing?"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 107s
Sleep 3s
